OL,3,AAnthropic shares close up 17% after
OL,4,Arecord-breaking stock market debut
OL,5,
OL,6,FAI firm Anthropic is being listed
OL,7,Fpublicly for the first time on Thursday
OL,8,Fon the Nasdaq stock market in New York
OL,10,FThe company's share price started at
OL,11,F$111.50, which at that stage gave it a
OL,12,Fmarket value close to $2tn - prices
OL,13,Fhave since dropped slightly to close at
OL,14,Faround $97
OL,16,FThat's still a steep jump from the $83
OL,17,Fset last night - take a closer look at
OL,18,Fsome of the numbers here
OL,20,FAnthropic, the company behind AI
OL,21,Fchatbot Claude, raised a record $81bn
OL,22,Fahead of its stock market debut
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
